# Build context is the repository root (see core-ai-sandbox-runtime/Dockerfile).
# The sandbox image needs core-ai-sandbox-runtime/ (Go sources, VERSION, go.mod/sum) and
# sdk/core-ai-session/ (the Python SDK). Everything heavy or irrelevant is kept out of the context.
.git
.gitignore
.core-ai
build
.gradle
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
core-ai-frontend
sdk/vectorstores
**/*.md